1892
01:26:26.728 --> 01:26:28.063
[grunts]

1893
01:26:28.689 --> 01:26:29.856
[audience gasps]

1894
01:26:29.857 --> 01:26:31.608
- [exclaims]
- [groans]

1895
01:26:32.609 --> 01:26:34.151
[groans]

1896
01:26:34.152 --> 01:26:35.236
You okay?

1897
01:26:35.237 --> 01:26:36.612
[audience applauding]

