What happens now?

1946
01:29:18.859 --> 01:29:20.027
[Kris] Now we wait.

1947
01:29:21.278 --> 01:29:22.778
- Seriously?
- Mm-hmm.

1948
01:29:22.779 --> 01:29:24.488
